OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones praised by fans
OL,4,Afor using Welsh accent in TV series
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine Zeta-Jones has been praised
OL,7,Fby fans as she uses her Welsh accent in
OL,8,Fan upcoming thriller series.
OL,10,FThe 56-year-old Hollywood actor
OL,11,Freturned to her hometown of Swansea,
OL,12,Fwhere some of the filming took place
OL,13,Ffor Amazon's Kill Jackie.
OL,15,FA trailer released on social media
OL,16,Fgives viewers their first glimpse of
OL,17,Fthe show, as well as a snippet of
OL,18,FZeta-Jones using her Swansea accent.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
