OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Oscar-winning star plays Jackie
OL,7,FPrice, an extravagant jet-setter who is
OL,8,Ftrying to stay anonymous after escaping
OL,9,Fa "dangerous past as an international
OL,10,Fcocaine dealer", according to Amazon
OL,11,FPrime.
